{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115520/extras/b7462de52d6d006e5b9a662b5ff933d2.poster.avif?t=1761786524\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115520/extras/b7462de52d6d006e5b9a662b5ff933d2.webm?t=1761786524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115520/extras/b7462de52d6d006e5b9a662b5ff933d2.mp4?t=1761786524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your golf club membership has been revoked! Times are tough and you could really use a round. Sneak into the course at nightfall with your trusty clubs and see where this adventure takes you. The local club is just the first tee in a world full of forbidden fairways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115520/extras/c6f53cc68275b4931e4b804e8c23bbd1.poster.avif?t=1761786524\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115520/extras/c6f53cc68275b4931e4b804e8c23bbd1.webm?t=1761786524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115520/extras/c6f53cc68275b4931e4b804e8c23bbd1.mp4?t=1761786524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115520/extras/e5838d501e7d531510337383d13e0274.avif?t=1761786524\" width=250 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunkers and rough are the least of your worries. Evade armed guards, avoid CCTV cameras, and play the flawless round. Slip through the cracks or go on the offensive and take them out with a well placed shot, leave no witnesses behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115520/extras/adf0cd1155490782bb2b571f76cc3ada.poster.avif?t=1761786524\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115520/extras/adf0cd1155490782bb2b571f76cc3ada.webm?t=1761786524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115520/extras/adf0cd1155490782bb2b571f76cc3ada.mp4?t=1761786524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115520/extras/e90220f606482f940bab6df6a9a326ff.avif?t=1761786524\" width=250 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a criminal golfer has its perks. Your crime spree will take you to exotic locations such as beaches, forests, cities, bank vaults, and military bunkers. The world is your golf course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115520/extras/91ce2252ee9d95edfec5a31380010074.poster.avif?t=1761786524\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115520/extras/91ce2252ee9d95edfec5a31380010074.webm?t=1761786524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta